"IdentityForgeModifier","pos":[250,400],"size":[400,200],"flags":{},"order":10,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"upstream","name":"upstream","shape":7,"type":"STRING","link":58},{"localized_name":"style_modifiers","name":"style_modifiers","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"style_modifiers"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"character_json","name":"character_json","type":"STRING","slot_index":0,"links":[56]}],"properties":{"cnr_id":"comfyui-identity-forge","ver":"0485c03c3d657ba466c5d28583e5086eeddd28d8","Node name for S&R":"IdentityForgeModifier"},"widgets_values":["# Prepend a descriptor to ONE element (or a whole group).\n# One per line ->  key: descriptor      (delete the # to use a line)\n# key = a FIELD (footwear, skin_tone, hair_color, earrings, eye_color, ...)\n#    or a GROUP (Body, Face, Hair, Makeup, Jewelry & Nails, Clothing, Setting & Shot)\n# Field names are the same labels shown on the Identity Forge node.\n#\n# THE ONE RULE: the descriptor goes IN FRONT of the value, it does not\n# replace it. So keep it to a 1-3 word adjective that reads naturally there.\n#   good ->  hair_color: living-flame   (becomes 'living-flame auburn')\n#   bad  ->  hair_style: nest of vipers (becomes 'nest of vipers messy bun')\n#\n# --- materials -------------------------------------------------------\n# skin_tone: iridescent\n# skin_tone: cracked molten\n# skin_tone: carved marble\n# skin_tone: moss-and-lichen\n# hair_color: living-flame\n# eye_color: glowing\n#\n# --- genres (a whole group at once) ----------------------------------\n# Clothing: cyberpunk neon\n# Clothing: baroque gilded\n# Clothing: post-apocalyptic weathered\n# footwear: anti-gravity hover\n#\n# --- whimsy ----------------------------------------------------------\n# Makeup: galaxy-glitter\n# earrings: tiny caged\n# Setting & Shot: storm-lit\n"],"widgets_values_named":{"style_modifiers":"# Prepend a descriptor to ONE element (or a whole group).\n# One per line ->  key: descriptor      (delete the # to use a line)\n# key = a FIELD (footwear, skin_tone, hair_color, earrings, eye_color, ...)\n#    or a GROUP (Body, Face, Hair, Makeup, Jewelry & Nails, Clothing, Setting & Shot)\n# Field names are the same labels shown on the Identity Forge node.\n#\n# THE ONE RULE: the descriptor goes IN FRONT of the value, it does not\n# replace it. So keep it to a 1-3 word adjective that reads naturally there.\n#   good ->  hair_color: living-flame   (becomes 'living-flame auburn')\n#   bad  ->  hair_style: nest of vipers (becomes 'nest of vipers messy bun')\n#\n# --- materials -------------------------------------------------------\n# skin_tone: iridescent\n# skin_tone: cracked molten\n# skin_tone: carved marble\n# skin_tone: moss-and-lichen\n# hair_color: living-flame\n# eye_color: glowing\n#\n# --- genres (a whole group at once) ----------------------------------\n# Clothing: cyberpunk neon\n# Clothing: baroque gilded\n# Clothing: post-apocalyptic weathered\n# footwear: anti-gravity hover\n#\n# --- whimsy ----------------------------------------------------------\n# Makeup: galaxy-glitter\n# earrings: tiny caged\n# Setting & Shot: storm-lit\n"}},{"id":62,"type":"Note","pos":[270,110],"size":[360,200],"flags":{},"order":4,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"properties":{},"widgets_values":["MODIFIER - tweak one field or group.\nPrepend a custom descriptor to a single field (footwear: sci-fi) or a whole group (Clothing: weathered).\nSet to None to pass upstream through unchanged."],"widgets_values_named":{"text":"MODIFIER - tweak one field or group.\nPrepend a custom descriptor to a single field (footwear: sci-fi) or a whole group (Clothing: weathered).\nSet to None to pass upstream through unchanged."},"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":61,"type":"Note","pos":[-100,-250],"size":[440,180],"flags":{},"order":5,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"properties":{},"widgets_values":["COSPLAYER - fictional character costume.\nMode 'Costume only' (default) sends costume + signature hair/eyes and lets the person randomize; 'Full character' also locks the physique for a faithful look.\nrandom_scope narrows Random picks to a franchise/category/attribute.\nCrossplay: set the person's gender independently of the character.\nUnmask toggle reveals the head under a full-mask suit.\nA named beast (Appa, Toothless...) renders as the animal, not a wearer."],"widgets_values_named":{"text":"COSPLAYER - fictional character costume.\nMode 'Costume only' (default) sends costume + signature hair/eyes and lets the person randomize; 'Full character' also locks the physique for a faithful look.\nrandom_scope narrows Random picks to a franchise/category/attribute.\nCrossplay: set the person's gender independently of the character.\nUnmask toggle reveals the head under a full-mask suit.\nA named beast (Appa, Toothless...) renders as the animal, not a wearer."},"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":60,"type":"Note","pos":[700,-230],"size":[480,220],"flags":{},"order":6,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"properties":{},"widgets_values":["IDENTITY FORGE - the character engine.\nEvery field is Random (roll) / a value (lock) / None (omit).\nSeed auto-randomizes each queue; set fixed to reproduce.\naccessory_density: drop to Minimal/None for clean portraits.\nsize_scale: manual only (Auto default, never random) - force giant/tiny.\nPreset nodes (Cosplayer/Archetype/Creature/Modifier) feed this node's archetype_json; the node CLOSEST to Identity Forge wins on overlap.\nPreset modes: Cosplayer 'Full character' vs 'Costume only'; Archetype 'Essentials' (default) vs 'Full preset' - they decide how much of the person is built."],"widgets_values_named":{"text":"IDENTITY FORGE - the character engine.\nEvery field is Random (roll) / a value (lock) / None (omit).\nSeed auto-randomizes each queue; set fixed to reproduce.\naccessory_density: drop to Minimal/None for clean portraits.\nsize_scale: manual only (Auto default, never random) - force giant/tiny.\nPreset nodes (Cosplayer/Archetype/Creature/Modifier) feed this node's archetype_json; the node CLOSEST to Identity Forge wins on overlap.\nPreset modes: Cosplayer 'Full character' vs 'Costume only'; Archetype 'Essentials' (default) vs 'Full preset' - they decide how much of the person is built."},"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":63,"type":"IdentityForgeCosplayer","pos":[-100,50],"size":[270,230],"flags":{},"order":7,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"upstream","name":"upstream","shape":7,"type":"STRING","link":null},{"localized_name":"character","name":"character","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"character"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"random_scope","name":"random_scope","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"random_scope"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"look_level","name":"look_level","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"look_level"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"mask","name":"mask","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"mask"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"props","name":"props","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"props"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"seed","name":"seed","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"seed"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"character_json","name":"character_json","type":"STRING","links":[57,58]}],"properties":{"cnr_id":"comfyui-identity-forge","ver":"66632622f97bc7fe217751793802f1f7fdd5359d","Node name for S&R":"IdentityForgeCosplayer"},"widgets_values":["Random — any","Any","Any","Full character","Default","Include signature prop",824534143267077,"randomize"],"widgets_values_named":{"character":"Random — any","franchise_filter":"Any","random_scope":"Any","look_level":"Full character","mask":"Default","props":"Include signature prop","seed":824534143267077,"randomize":"randomize"}}],"links":[[3,4,0,7,0,"MODEL"],[4,5,0,7,1,"CLIP"],[7,7,1,9,0,"CLIP"],[8,9,0,10,0,"CONDITIONING"],[10,9,0,12,1,"CONDITIONING"],[11,10,0,12,2,"CONDITIONING"],[12,11,0,12,3,"LATENT"],[13,12,0,13,0,"LATENT"],[14,6,0,13,1,"VAE"],[18,8,0,21,0,"STRING"],[19,21,0,9,1,"STRING"],[28,37,